      <!-- SECTION 1 -->
      <section class="section" id="market-opportunity">
        <h2>Market Opportunity: The Rise of Hygiene Consciousness</h2>
        <p>
          The global demand for household and industrial hygiene products has seen an unprecedented surge over the last decade, particularly in emerging markets like India and Southeast Asia. Entrepreneurs entering this space are often met with a landscape that requires a delicate balance of technical efficacy and cost-optimization to succeed in a manufacturing business. This balance is critical to compete with established giants while maintaining a highly profitable bottom line.
        </p>
        <p>
          The toilet bowl cleaner segment is one of the most stable categories within the home care industry, driven by recurring demand and increasing urbanization. To build a brand that resonates with both retail consumers and institutional clients, one must move beyond basic "DIY" recipes and adopt a professional industrial approach. This transition requires a detailed understanding of the market dynamics, technological innovations, and scalability factors that govern the sector:
        </p>
        <ul style="padding-left: 20px; margin-bottom: 24px;">
          <li><strong>Shift to Branded Solutions</strong>: An increasing global shift from local unbranded products to branded, high-efficacy hygiene solutions driven by awareness.</li>
          <li><strong>Institutional Segment Growth</strong>: Exponential growth in the B2B institutional segment, including hospitals, hospitality, corporate offices, and transit hubs.</li>
          <li><strong>Eco-Friendly Chemical Focus</strong>: Technological innovation focusing heavily on eco-friendly, biodegradable, and safer organic acidic agents.</li>
          <li><strong>High Industry Profit Margins</strong>: Excellent profit margins for chemical manufacturing businesses that master lean operations, local raw material sourcing, and efficient distribution networks.</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <!-- Image 2 -->
      <div class="image-slot">
        <img 
          src="https://assets.zyrosite.com/AGBzPMBJDQiwDGny/rd-formulation-laboratory-equipment-setup-Afmwczp7SgGXEOI8.webp" 
          alt="R&D chemical formulation laboratory setup featuring precision glassware, titration setups, and chemical testing equipment for detergent stability analysis" 
          loading="lazy" 
        />
